title Try a look, keep it with k, and quit with q without installing: vtium-config says that the saved draft is not in use yet and how to install it.
waits-for CF1 item 5: a font saved in the look is lost on q

file etc/vtium.conf
    version = 1
    font-name = unifont
    [head console]
    vt = 5
file etc/batch.conf
    ROOT/fonts/mono.bdf
font fonts/mono.bdf 8x16
frit mono
    source=bdf:ROOT/fonts/mono.bdf

press 3 n
press Backspace Backspace Backspace Backspace Backspace Backspace Backspace Backspace
type "big"
press Enter Down Right Esc
press t k
at the kept trial
check console draws mono

press q
at the quit question
check screen shows "y save and quit"
check screen shows "install"
press y
at the end
check exited 0
check draft look big font-name mono
check installed lacks "big"
# The console draws the font it drew before vtium-config started.
check console draws unifont
